IA05: API Contract and Failure-Response Walkthrough
1. API Endpoint Specification
Endpoint: POST /api/v1/orders

Description: Submits a new customer order with delivery address coordinates and line items.

Authentication: Bearer token (JWT).

2. Request Payload Schema (JSON)
JSON
{
  "customer_name": "Kofi Mensah",
  "phone_number": "+233541234567",
  "delivery_address": "East Legon, Accra",
  "items": [
    {
      "menu_item_id": "item_jollof_01",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}
3. Response Schemas and Error Handling
Success Response (HTTP 201 Created): Returns order ID, calculated distance delivery fee, and status PENDING.

Error Response (HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity): Missing required contact details or delivery coordinates.

Error Response (HTTP 409 Conflict): Inventory stock insufficient for requested item quantity.
